@startuml
!theme plain

skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei,SimHei,SimSun,sans-serif
skinparam classFontName Microsoft YaHei,SimHei,SimSun,sans-serif
skinparam sequenceMessageFontName Microsoft YaHei,SimHei,SimSun,sans-serif

title 变异步过滤 —— 样本生成完整流程

actor "CLI\n(create_samples.py)" as CLI

participant "SampleCreator" as SC
participant "game_filter\n(should_keep_game)" as GF

database "record.json" as REC
database "samples.json" as OUT

== ① 对局级过滤（不变）==

CLI -> REC : 遍历 record.json 文件列表
CLI -> SC : create(record_files,\n  record_filter=should_keep_game,\n  move_filter=is_variant_move)

loop 每局 record
    SC -> REC : ② 读取 record.json
    SC -> SC : ③ winner ∈ {0,3} or history 为空?\n→ 跳过本局

    SC -> GF : ④ record_filter(record)
    alt record_filter 返回 False
        SC -> SC : 跳过本局
    else record_filter 返回 True (采样方获胜)
        note right
          --temp-side 默认 random\n每局随机决定采样方
        end note
    end

== ⑤ 步级过滤（始终生效）==

    loop 获胜方每一步
        SC -> SC : ⑥ move_filter(step)
        alt 非变异步 (实际位置 ∈ argmax 集合)
            SC -> SC : 跳过此步, skipped_moves++
        else 变异步 (实际位置 ∉ argmax 集合)
            SC -> SC : ⑦ 保留, variant_moves++
            SC -> SC : ⑧ 构造软标签 output
            SC -> SC : ⑨ D4 增强 (默认 8 变换)
        end
    end
end

== ⑩ 统计输出 ==

SC --> CLI : ⑪ 返回 (samples, stats)
CLI -> CLI : ⑫ 打印统计信息
note right
  对局级: 保留对局 / 过滤对局
  步级: 总步数 / 变异步 / 跳过
  最终样本数
end note

CLI -> OUT : ⑬ 写入 samples.json

@enduml
